---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PUBLIC_SITE_URL } from '../lib/site';

const siteUrl = PUBLIC_SITE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Team Chords"
  description="The terms that govern use of the Team Chords public site and related services."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-gray-900/5 sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600">Last updated: 2026-01-02</p>
    </header>

    <div class="post-body mt-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-gray-900/5 sm:p-8">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to <strong>Team Chords</strong>. These Terms govern your use of <strong>{siteUrl}</strong> and the related Service operated by Team Chords.</p>
      <p>By using the Service, you agree to these Terms and to our Privacy Policy.</p>
      <p>If you do not agree, please do not use the Service and contact <strong>support@teamchords.com</strong> if you would like to discuss it.</p>

      <h2>2. Communications</h2>
      <p>By using the Service, you agree to receive service-related communications. You may opt out of marketing messages by following the unsubscribe link or contacting support.</p>

      <h2>3. Purchases and Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>If we offer products or services for purchase, you agree to provide accurate billing information and authorize us to use third-party payment processors as needed.</p>
      <p>Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled before the next billing cycle. Subscription payments are non-refundable except where required by law.</p>

      <h2>4. Content and Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for the content you post or submit through the Service. You agree not to use the Service for unlawful, harmful, or disruptive activities, including attempts to access systems without authorization or interfere with other users.</p>

      <h2>5. Accounts</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and for all activity under your account.</p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>The Service and its original content, features, and functionality are the property of Team Chords and its licensors.</p>

      <h2>7. Copyright Policy</h2>
      <p>We respect the intellectual property rights of others and will respond to valid copyright infringement claims sent to <strong>support@teamchords.com</strong>.</p>

      <h2>8. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
      <p>The Service may include links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for their content, policies, or practices.</p>
      <p>This Terms template was originally produced with <a href="https://policymaker.io/terms-and-conditions/">PolicyMaker.io</a>.</p>

      <h2>9. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>The Service is provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available&quot; basis. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Team Chords disclaims warranties and limits liability for indirect or consequential damages.</p>

      <h2>10. Termination and Changes</h2>
      <p>We may suspend or terminate access to the Service at any time if you violate these Terms or for other operational reasons.</p>
      <p>We may revise these Terms from time to time by posting the updated version on this page.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Please send feedback, comments, or support requests to <strong>support@teamchords.com</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>